{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xMJVCFpg1D1795070139.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>財政司司長陳茂波指，國家「十五五」規劃，支持香港發展為區域知識產權貿易中心，本港將利用金融業優勢，協助亞洲區內創意走向世界。</p><p></p><p>財政司司長陳茂波表示：「香港能作為測試創意的場所，我們將於內地及全球夥伴分享經驗。我們的任務是讓創意更容易被看見、融資及交易，令規則適應人工智能時代，從而使亞洲的創意走向世界，並證明其價值。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.418413+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:33:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T09:37:11.354086+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T07:17:16.277389+00:00","content_hash":"dc100ee29d8c489e9dfbe33eac83ecfdc8e60f43468f2ccb6a1a568e613a88cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T07:23:56.418413+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}